sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Learner
  participant I as interactor
  participant R as AiTutorRepository
  participant API as api.mimo.org
  U->>I: ask
  I->>R: SystemMessage + UserMessage
  R->>API: POST /v1/aiTutor/conversations (Accept: text/event-stream)
  loop SSE
    API-->>R: {content, conversationId, finishReason}
    R-->>U: append text
  end
